==Acquisition==
*Can be acquired by attaining the rank of '''Partner''' under {{Faction|The Perrin Sequence}}, or the rank of '''Flawless''' under {{Faction|New Loka}}, and spending {{sc|25,000}} to purchase.

==Notes==
*{{Stat|Armor}} reduction is affected by {{Stat|Ability Strength}}, fully removing {{Stat|Armor}} at '''167%''' {{Stat|Ability Strength}}.
*{{Stat|Armor}} reduction is temporary, enemies will regain their {{Stat|Armor}} when no longer tethered.

==Tips==
*With one player using {{M|Corrosive Projection}}, 100% {{Stat|Armor}} reduction can be achieved at 137% {{Stat|Ability Strength}}.

==Trivia==
*The image of the mod depicts {{WF|Trinity}} surrounded by basic {{Faction|Corpus}} units that don't have armor to begin with.

